{"4370990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FEED IT", "steam_appid": 4370990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4831570], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEED IT is a short-form horror experience featuring multiple paths towards completion, secrets to uncover, and a constant choice you'll have to face right from the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The TV is too loud for you. The monster's hunger grows, they're in charge, and you better hurry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370990/extras/6191b7d1ff3917eaf10e65757cc63ad2.avif?t=1788173926\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370990/extras_big/6191b7d1ff3917eaf10e65757cc63ad2.webp?t=1788173926 width=1560 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place is a maze, make sure to pay attention and search in every nook and cranny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370990/extras/3931cc3ad760edf76e7a5fb3fcffe03d.poster.avif?t=1788173926\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370990/extras/3931cc3ad760edf76e7a5fb3fcffe03d.webm?t=1788173926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370990/extras/3931cc3ad760edf76e7a5fb3fcffe03d.mp4?t=1788173926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat